{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18513","headline":"和严长官秋日登太原龙兴寺阁野望 · 欧阳詹","name":"和严长官秋日登太原龙兴寺阁野望","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"百丈化城楼，君登最上头。\n九霄回栈路，八到视幷州。\n烟火遗尧庶，山河啓圣猷。\n短垣齐介岭，片白指分流。\n清铎中天籁，哀鸣下界秋。\n境闲知道胜，心远见名浮。\n岂念乘肥马，方应驾大牛。\n自怜蓬逐吹，不得与良游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"欧阳詹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18513.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18513","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}